@dwex
title: CV-03 - Convoyer not adjacent to army's destination
desc:  The fleet sits on a sea field, but its neighbours don't include
       the army's intended destination. Geography phase rejects under
       GEO-006 (convoyer not adjacent to both army start and dest); the
       army's cmove fails because no valid route exists.

map {
  Lon LCB 0, 0.0
  NTH O   1, 0.6
  Bel LC  2, 0.0
  Lon --F NTH
}

orders {
  En A Lon mve Bel !
  En F NTH con Lon
}
@end
